   "text": "I've sent your free replacement.\n\n- **Replacement order:** RP-900\n- **Items:** Harvest bowl and Green juice\n- **Delivering to:** 58 Aspen Way, Oakdale, CA 94619\n- **Arriving in:** about 45\u201360 minutes\n- **Cost:** $0. You won't be charged for it.\n\nThe original order K-6303 is now marked \"not delivered.\" Since you're getting the replacement, that order won't be refunded as well. You may also see a pending $28.03 hold from when you placed it. Like the other one, that hold was already voided and should drop off your statement within 1\u20133 business days.\n\nHere's what we did tonight:\n- **K-6301 (Lotus Garden):** cancelled, with $30.18 refunded to your Visa\n- **K-6302 (Burger Barn):** couldn't be redirected because it was already picked up. It's still heading to 58 Aspen Way.\n- **K-6303 (Green Bowl):** free replacement on its way\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
